or patients with multiple chronic conditions (MCCs)#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#A fuzzy based dietary clinical decision support system for patients with multiple chronic conditions (MCCs)#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#A fuzzy based dietary clinical decision support system for patients with multiple chronic conditions (MCCs)#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#A fuzzy based dietary clinical decision support system for patients with multiple chronic conditions (MCCs)#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/LNYGTB5W","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=1&annotation=4P3XYM9T","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=1&annotation=FD3V2MH7","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=1&annotation=HHK5XC7A","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=6&annotation=CP33LF5G","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=1&annotation=BSTWMMF9","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=6&annotation=DABKJKYI","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=6&annotation=XMW8UUGG","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/XRZER53U?page=6&annotation=LXCW469Q","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"A fuzzy based dietary clinical decision support system for patients with multiple chronic conditions (MCCs)","Authors":"Leila Marashi-Hosseini, Sima Jafarirad, Ali Mohammad Hadianfard","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.1038/s41598-023-39371-4","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"consuming. In this study, a clinical decision support system based on fuzzy logic was modeled and evaluated to aid dietitians in adjusting the diet for patients with MCCsMCCs. Mamdani fuzzy logic with 1144 rules was applied to design the model for MCCs patients over 18 years who suffer from one or more chronic diseases, including obesity, diabetes, hypertension, hyperlipidemia, and kidney disease.","Findings":"The findings showed that the diet set by nutritionists had no statistically significant difference from the diet recommended by the fuzzy model (p> 0.05), and there was a strong correlation close to one between them. In addition, the results indicated a suitable model performance with an accuracy of about 97%The system was able to estimate the number of macronutrients and main food groups required by each patient.","Conclusions":"This system could adjust the diet with high accuracy as well as humans. In addition, it could increase dietitians’ confidence, precision, and speed in setting the diet for MCCs patients.However, the novelty of this study was to propose a model to help dietitians adjust the diet for patients with MCCs by calculating the number of macronutrients according to daily energy consumption, weight, the conditions that the patient is suffering from, dietary guidelines, and nutrient substitution table.The results suggested the fuzzy logic algorithm can be a suitable method in designing CDSSs for diet recommendation. The proposed system enhanced the reliability, speed, and accuracy of the decision-making of dietitians in setting an optimal diet for patients with MCCs. The system can further be extended to include the rules related to the intake of micronutrients and fluids. In addition, by adding other MCCs and developing its knowledge base, this system can be helpful in clinical decision-making and providing suitable diets for different patien","Limitations":"Therefore, the incomplete nutritional patient records, as well as the variety in diet recommendations, were other study limitations","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"178noh4","at":1774939551382}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/marashi-hosseiniFuzzyBasedDietary2023.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.10374706,0.00038359,-0.01131888,0.02688006,-0.05288983,0.03058938,0.02853417,0.03605843,0.0418886,0.03311395,0.02089007,-0.11346741,0.02077222,0.00656829,0.06490503,-0.01591383,0.04938061,0.0299748,-0.00906066,0.03318676,0.0888116,-0.044928,-0.02062871,0.00470849,0.01808295,-0.00201961,0.0084976,-0.03438297,-0.05793118,-0.22894272,0.01138314,-0.02220726,0.07644483,-0.03376454,-0.07636829,-0.02266601,-0.0204507,0.04238116,-0.05948654,0.03563793,0.0478701,0.0495685,0.09697042,-0.04658933,0.00743567,-0.02767375,-0.05325354,0.00593336,-0.04753348,0.00154089,-0.03672598,-0.01137248,0.04037252,0.02049454,0.05707571,0.07400198,0.03412159,0.03006787,0.02443653,0.06387253,0.00295698,0.07776671,-0.1976843,0.04717203,0.04042973,-0.01155003,-0.0411299,-0.01260601,0.081662,-0.00399285,-0.05504362,0.01779385,-0.01577541,0.07442176,0.00480034,-0.02457274,0.05849805,-0.02987948,-0.03073661,0.02925653,-0.06298987,0.03709933,-0.03575718,-0.03868018,-0.01115362,0.00524885,-0.04091778,-0.08629441,-0.00157285,-0.00671383,-0.00996894,-0.04937387,-0.00360008,-0.01906663,-0.02495872,-0.0228252,-0.00176851,-0.03446639,-0.03494086,0.12310493,-0.00840726,-0.01336513,0.01140837,-0.01471451,0.03256176,-0.04173166,-0.04600397,-0.04672386,0.00718317,-0.0049278,0.01926246,0.00756495,0.04893327,0.02794304,-0.06819361,0.11197148,0.08938383,0.03109322,0.03147067,0.0189152,-0.02613811,0.00401182,0.09035699,0.02637629,0.00908706,0.00820941,-0.02124858,0.08355167,-0.06264313,0.00442202,0.08386206,-0.02250269,-0.03201205,-0.00641434,0.01079725,-0.00145377,0.05284249,0.02278349,0.00747546,0.02034172,-0.00605025,-0.04911865,0.0114612,-0.12556097,-0.06962512,0.12026704,-0.01287048,0.02510042,-0.06440315,-0.03265,0.05853274,0.00611611,-0.03249151,-0.02173595,-0.05249627,0.04980761,-0.007477